installationInstructions:
**Base theme:**

```css
@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/LitCastVlog/Flow@main/CSS/ScyFlow-main.css');
```

**Extras** (smaller cast/crew section, B/W logo, hides "Upcoming on TV" / "Next Up" in season view):

```css
@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/LitCastVlog/Flow@main/CSS/ScyFlow-Extras.css');
```

Paste into a Custom CSS box. See the [README](https://github.com/LitCastVlog/Flow#readme) for optional add-ons like the collapsible drawer, episode grid, rounded cast/crew, and color presets.
